<div class="card"><h3>分销商(有邀请记录的会员)</h3><p class="muted">佣金比例与邀请奖励积分可在「站点设置」调整。佣金在被邀请人订单确认收货后产生,订单退款将撤销。</p>
<table class="t"><tr><th>会员</th><th>邀请码</th><th>邀请人数</th><th>累计佣金</th><th>可提现</th></tr><% rows.forEach(x=>{ %><tr><td><a href="/admin/members/<%= x.id %>"><%= x.nickname %></a> <span class="muted"><%= x.phone %></span></td><td><%= x.invite_code %></td><td><%= x.invitees %></td><td>¥<%= x.total.toFixed(2) %></td><td>¥<%= x.available.toFixed(2) %></td></tr><% }) %></table></div>
<div class="card"><h3>最近佣金流水</h3><table class="t"><tr><th>时间</th><th>受益人</th><th>来源会员</th><th>订单</th><th>佣金</th><th>状态</th></tr><% recent.forEach(c=>{ %><tr><td class="muted"><%= c.created_at %></td><td><%= c.an %></td><td><%= c.bn %></td><td><a href="/admin/orders/<%= c.order_id %>"><%= c.order_no %></a></td><td>¥<%= c.amount.toFixed(2) %></td><td><%= {available:'可提现',settled:'已结算',revoked:'已撤销'}[c.status] %></td></tr><% }) %></table></div>
